      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.921
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "福冈警方随即发出全国通缉，寻找他的踪迹。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "1cf23704dae196468a955d28adc56b7c93b0aeeb5407fbda7ba2ebe6c6cbeb72",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.725
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "逃亡途中，西口从报纸上得知，自己已被通缉。",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "sha256": "82fcb8376473a00da3773fd0b214b1d0fa1dea6da180be140c3d1f0030fdcd35",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.516
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "濑户内海的渡轮上，他留下一双鞋和一封信。",
